                    "message": "Quick question \u2014 why we need to separate 91236 and 91237??\nOn its own, 91236 only adds the encode/decode helpers with no runtime caller, so it lands as dead code until 91237 wires it into discovery.\nNo strong, just raising it as a preference. Thanks!"
